osl-ephys
Copyright 2021-present University of Oxford, Oxford, UK.

This product includes software developed at the Oxford Centre for Human Brain
Activity (OHBA), University of Oxford.

Parts of the M/EEG processing code are shared with osl-dynamics
(https://github.com/OHBA-analysis/osl-dynamics), also developed at OHBA and
released under the Apache License 2.0.

osl-ephys downloads the neuroimaging templates, surfaces and parcellations it
uses from https://github.com/OHBA-analysis/osl-files rather than bundling
them. They remain the work of their original authors, who should be cited when
they are used; that repository records the source and licence of each one.
